window.products.push({"id":199085,"name":"Chef Cooking Apron for Men Women Canvas Kitchen Apron with Cross Back and 3 Pockets","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":20.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81VB9f6pGjL._AC_UL1500_.jpg","description":"Canvas,Oxford Fabric Buckle closure machine wash 【Durable, Water Resistant Canvas】 The canvas apron with pockets does what a canvas should do, but for an extraordinarily long period. Made from premium quality 16A Oxford fabric, this mens waxed canvas apron is sure to last years. The high-density and thickened material has all the qualities of wear resistance and durability while still maintaining water resistant capabilities. As a chef, you will be able to get in the kitchen in your favorite shirt without worrying about splatters and stains 【Cross-Back Straps, Multipurpose Pockets】 The cross-back design ensures the carpenter aprons for men with pockets remains in place and feels comfortable throughout, unlike the traditional design, which punishes your neck with all the apron's weight. There are multipurpose pockets that make the cross back canvas apron a favorite for the cooks and the mechanics. The pockets snuggle on scissors, spanners, pens, etc., so you can freely roam without holding onto the pocket to avoid dropping a tool 【Cooking and Multi-Occasion】 The mens cooking apron canvas is a unisex product that can be used across a range of occasions. May it be outdoor grilling, barbecuing, indoor kitchen prep work, gardening, camping or even in a barbershop, this is the most purposeful waxed canvas shop apron to grace the occasion in. Spread the love by gifting your friends with a canvas grilling aprons this Christmas and wait for their most profound appreciation 【Adjustable strap】 The straps of the canvas aprons for men cooking are not only adjustable but also detachable. With a width of 25.6\" by 29.9\" and a strap length of up to 66.9\", the adjustable cross back canvas apron for women men is fit for anyone- whether tall, short, slender or plumb! The metal buckles of the canvas aprons for men cooking are strong enough to retain their grip and still easy to operate when taking off the apron or adjusting 【Stylish Look】 Apart from the easily distinguishable novel style in the waxed canvas apron for men, the color combination breathes a versatile and classic style that's easy with almost any dressing style. If you prefer cool and cute, the canvas kitchen aprons for men brings about the best of that. For men, donning a carpenters apron with pockets canvas emphasizes the handsome and masculine traits- it's an heavy duty waxed canvas shop apron for just about anyone","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81VB9f6pGjL._AC_UL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SAMATI","source_asin":"B09ZTY39C4","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-199085","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09ZTY39C4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09ZTY39C4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
