window.products.push({"id":199240,"name":"TmiAod 2-Pack CD/DVD Case Storage Bags and 100 Pieces CD Sleeves DVD Sleeves Envelope Holder with Clear Window and Flap","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81s5e+jCO7L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This order contains 2-pack DVD storage bags and 100 piece CD/DVD sleeves.You can use DVD collection bags to storage the bulk of your DVD/Blu-ray/game collection. The amount you can store in each bag depends on their thickness.Each DVD storage bag can fit up t0 37 DVDs(if they are more thicker) or 40 DVDs’ case(if the case is standard sized) and even more 42(like 14mm or less 14mm thick). The DVD organizer bags are designed for DVD sized cases, though Blu-ray/PS4 cases fit in perfectly fine. The shorter height of Blu-ray/PS4 cases also allows for more to lay on top with ease (up to six, I'd say). DVD case height restricts this, though you can get away with laying two additional DVDs if placed in the center away from the ends of the bag where the zipper is tighter. A full bag of DVDs/Blu-rays/games is easy to carry around with no flimsiness to it. These storage bags work great for either DVDs (upright) or VHS tapes (sideways).100 piece CD/DVD sleeves to protect your discs.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81s5e+jCO7L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"N/H","source_asin":"B08JSGVPTL","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-199240","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08JSGVPTL","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08JSGVPTL","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":199241,"name":"Music Area Rugs Carpets,Collection of Musical Instruments Symphony Orchestra Concert Composition Theme Print Area Rugs Carpets,4'x 6'Oval,for Living R","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61MHChaWRkS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Functional and Fashionable Add a functional work of art to your living room, dining room or bedroom with an Collection area rug. This elegant and versatile floor rug features a classic color combination that blends in elegantly with a wide array of color schemes and home furnishings. The beautifully detailed pattern adds texture, warmth and dimension to your space while remaining subtle enough to complement rather than compete with the rest of the décor LIVING ROOM For larger rooms, select a size that allows for all furniture to rest entirely on the rug. For smaller rooms, use a rug size that allows all furniture to be positioned off the rug or with only the front legs on the rug. BEDROOM For a coordinated look, you’ll want a large rug that frames your bed and night stands. Consider the size of your bed(s) and aim for 18 inches of rug to step onto on both sides of any bed. An alternative layout is to “sandwich” the bed with runners on either side. DINING ROOM Consider the size of the room and your dining room table, including the number of chairs. Rugs should be laid to expose at least 18 inches of exposed floor around the perimeter of the room. Leave 18 to 24 inches of rug around the table to allow for chairs to get pushed back. SPOT CLEAN AS NEEDED Machine wash and air dry.Strong materials will stand up to regular wear and tear for years of stylish comfort. This durable indoor area rug can be easily maintained with regular vacuuming and spot cleaning as needed. USE A RUG PAD A non-slip rug pad’s primary benefits are safety and cushioning. However, it also prolongs the life of your rug and makes it easier to vacuum.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61MHChaWRkS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"LCGGDB","source_asin":"B093PXMV28","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-199241","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B093PXMV28","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B093PXMV28","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
