window.products.push({"id":199472,"name":"Plume Interior Decor 4 Extra Long and Fluffy Pampas Grass Stems. Natural Dried Pampas Grass. Up to 4 Feet.","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":59.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91g96cCMrNS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"PAMPAS PRETTY Beautiful naturally dried and harvested plumes which have a very long shelf life when used as décor because, well.... they are naturally dried!These are REAL natural products  each piece is unique and has its own characteristics. Pampas Grass is an incredibly stunning feature on your kitchen table, styled in your entryway, or simply in a minimalist vase in any corner of your home. Featured in vases lining aisles, gracefully draped over arches, or delicately utilized in bridal bouquets, pampas grass is increasingly becoming a staple in weddings across the world. Our pampas grass is sure to be the talking point of your dinner party or wedding. Some of the benefits include: ✅ Extra Large & Fluffy ✅ Low Maintenance - No Water Needed✅ On Trend Boho Home Decor✅ No Shedding - Can Last Up to 3 Years✅ Care Guide Included✅ Approximately 47\" Tall PLEASE NOTE: — Size, color, shape and fluffiness of each plume of pampas may vary.— The pampas plumes will be compressed during shipping. Please follow included instructions on fluffing them back up. They will be 4x bigger if you follow this instruction. — The pampas grass should not be placed in a vase with water.— Vase not included!.— Be gentle when opening the package. We recommend opening up the whole package before taking out the grass.Highlight your home or event with natural beauty, love the experience, and sensations received from your guests. When choosing your pampas grass - choose Plume!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91g96cCMrNS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Plume","source_asin":"B09CDYVHGD","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-199472","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09CDYVHGD","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09CDYVHGD","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":199473,"name":"Department 56 Dickens' Village Six Jolly Fellowship Porters Lit House, 6.9 inch","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":114.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91MAVD+4wTL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"One Christmas evening, a group of friends set off to enjoy a dinner of celebration at a small country inn nestled in a quiet river town. As they rounded a bend in the road, they saw the small, old-fashioned village decorated for the holidays. The lights, like fairies, glowed and sparkled amid the freshly fallen snow. All evening, the conversation was full of Christmas memories and the visions the tiny town had evoked. Amidst the jovial banter and magical memories, the idea for a lighted Christmas village was born. That spark of an idea became a reality when, in 1976, Department 56 introduced a series of six hand-painted, ceramic buildings. The rest is history.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91MAVD+4wTL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Department 56","source_asin":"B00AXTHUF6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-199473","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00AXTHUF6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00AXTHUF6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
