window.products.push({"id":199499,"name":"Londo Genuine Leather Eyeglasses & Sunglasses Case with Magnetic Snap Closure","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71tssJiZ0tL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"100% Leather Imported EXQUISITE LEATHER CRAFTSMANSHIP – The Londo Eyeglass Case is crafted with high quality, genuine cowhide leather attached with fine and durable stitching, giving it a sleek look and a slim body. An exemplary model of artisanal craft combining the pleasant feel and the handsome look of leather without sacrificing versatility and convenience. MAXIMUM PROTECTION - The Londo Genuine Leather Eyeglass Case is designed for maximum protection of your Eyeglasses, whether you carry them on yourself or in a bag. The inside of the case is composed of a soft layer, preventing scratches on your glasses. MINIMALIST DESIGN - The Londo Genuine Leather Eyeglass Case is designed to prevent bulk, without sacrificing elegant looks. Dimensions are 6.3 x 2.75 x 1.5 inch. CONVENIENT – The Londo Genuine Leather Eyeglass Case is designed to be a convenient accessory; you can easily access your glasses with the flick of the magnetic snap. TRAVEL with STYLE - The Londo Genuine Leather Eyeglass Case is unisex and comes in 5 colors, red, olive, camel, cinnamon, and black. Choose the style that best fits your personality or consider it as a gift for father’s day, mother’s day, thanksgiving, Christmas and birthdays. The Londo Genuine Leather Eyeglass Case is a versatile gift.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71tssJiZ0tL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Londo","source_asin":"B0C5T4T9QB","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-199499","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C5T4T9QB","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C5T4T9QB","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":199500,"name":"Sandicast Christmas Ornament, Brown White","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":15.57,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81WZOwBzeTL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"When the Holiday season arrives, don't forget that pets love the festivities just as much as we do. Sandicast's charming collection of Christmas ornaments features over 40 different breeds of man's best friend enjoying the holiday spirit in a variety of ways: some sport bright red Santa hats or are cozily wrapped in winter scarves, others are decked out in strings of lights or carrying Christmas stockings. Several breeds are also available in multiple expressions and poses (sitting, standing, lying, sitting pretty or crouching), each one \"decorated\" for holidays in a different way. Sandicast Christmas ornaments have a securely attached metallic cord loop for hanging and are packaged in a protective reusable box that's perfect for year-round storage. But don't feel compelled to put that special ornament away just because the holidays are over we won't tell. Sandicast was founded in 1981 when artist Sandra Brue realized her dream of combining her artistic talent and her lifelong love of animals. Because of the superb quality of her work, collectors around the world now pursue the demand for Sandicast animal sculptures. Queen Elizabeth and President Clinton are just a few of the many celebrities that have Sandicast animals. Sandra has sculpted more than 400 animals; the Sandicast Collection includes everything from dogs and cats to exotic wildlife. Each piece is hand-cast and hand-painted and virtually comes to life when sparkling glass eyes are inserted. Sandicast invites you to discover their extensive collection of hand sculpted animals available on Amazon.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81WZOwBzeTL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Sandicast","source_asin":"B01EIAQT8E","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-199500","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01EIAQT8E","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01EIAQT8E","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
