window.products.push({"id":199507,"name":"Helium (He) Periodic Table Element - Mad Science Party Balloons (16 pcs, 2-Sided) by Nerdy Words (Assorted)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":13.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61yOkG52yjL._AC_SL1106_.jpg","description":"NOW PRINTED ON TWO SIDES! These clever balloons feature the helium periodic table element and will make a funny addition to your next science-themed event (quite literally they will spell out He He He). Perfect for birthdays, graduations and science lab gatherings. Balloons are helium quality and come in 8 colors (Yellow, Lime, Orange, Aqua, Blue, Red, Pink, Purple). 16 balloons in each pack. BALLOON SPECIFICATIONS: Material: Helium Quality, 100% Biodegradable Latex Material: Helium Quality, 100% Biodegradable Latex Size: 12 Inch (30 cm) Size: 12 Inch (30 cm) Colors: Yellow, Lime, Orange, Aqua, Blue, Red, Pink, Purple Colors: Yellow, Lime, Orange, Aqua, Blue, Red, Pink, Purple Package: 16 Balloons Package: 16 Balloons Design: White Ink, 2-Side Design: White Ink, 2-Side BALLOON INFLATION: If the balloons are properly inflated (ie. not over- or under-inflated) they will last about 8-14 hours if helium filled and 5-7 days if air filled. Actual flying time will vary depending on temperature and atmospheric conditions. **If left outside in the hot sun or rain, the balloons will last only a few hours.** WARNING! CHOKING HAZARD - Children under 8 years can choke or suffocate on uninflated or broken balloons. Adult supervision required. Keep uninflated balloons away from children. Discard broken balloons at once. MISE EN GARDE! DANGER D'ÉTOUFFEMENT - Les enfants de moins de 8 ans peuvent s'étouffer ou suffoquer avec des ballons non gonflés ou éclatés. La surveillance doit être assurée par un adulte. Tenir les ballons non gonflés à l'écart des enfants. Jeter immédiatement les ballons éclatés.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61yOkG52yjL._AC_SL1106_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Nerdy Words","source_asin":"B0759Y16CL","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-199507","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0759Y16CL","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0759Y16CL","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
