window.products.push({"id":199637,"name":"OmieBox Bento Box for Kids + OmieBox (2 pack) Leakproof Dips Containers To Go, Salad Dressing Container","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":54.9,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Vp-ekBiZL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"BUNDLE PACK - Your order arrives with one OmieBox and one Dip Container Set (2pcs) KIDS EAT BETTER -- Your kids will gobble lunch up when it’s their favorite food served warm inside OmieBox. OmieBox bento box for kids with a THERMOS INSERT lets you easily pack hot and cold food. Send their favorite pasta, soup, or last night’s leftovers. Your kids will enjoy healthy lunches with more variety in OmieBox insulated container for hot food. EASIER, FASTER LUNCH PREP -- Now you can send hot soup and chilled strawberries without using a million small lunch box containers. OmieBox is a bento box for kids with thermos that packs hot & cold food together. This thermal lunch box for kids is great for hot lunch, cold food, or snacks.You won’t find another insulated lunch box for hot food that works as well as OmieBox! HIGH QUALITY INVESTMENT - Durable, built to last and saves you the expense of buying a separate kids thermos! OmieBox weighs a sturdy 1.7 lbs and uses 18/8, 304 grade stainless steel. It’s FDA, CPSIA compliant and BPA-Free insulated bento box / hot lunch box for kids. DIP CONTAINERS - Fits OmieBox perfectly. Each container fits up to 4-ounces and is completely leakproof, making it perfect for dips, dressing or yogurt. Use without lid to create create partitions inside your OmieBox. Or simply use it for snacks on the go. The 4-ounce capacity is ideal for berries & crackers.100% leak-proof, made of food grade silicone. BPA-free, Phthalate-free.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Vp-ekBiZL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Omie","source_asin":"B09T8HMRLL","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-199637","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09T8HMRLL","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09T8HMRLL","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":199638,"name":"Opulic Unbreakable Stemless Wine Glasses with Thick Bottom (15oz) - Set of 4 Wine Glass Tumbler, Made of 100% Shatterproof Plastic, Suitable for Wine ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61aC9g442kL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Does the frustration of clearing up the mess of broken glass pieces or spilled drinks caused by your guests ruining your day at the party? Introducing the shatterproof stemless wine glasses that will save you from unwanted attention of broken glasses. Non Breakable Tritan Material Each stemless wine glass is made out of Tritan plastic material, that is sturdy, durable, BPA free and able to withstand thecold of your slushie to your hot beverage like coffee or tea. Thickened Body and Base Design The stemless, thickened design allows for a lower center of gravity so that your wine glass does not tip over easily compared toa traditional stem wine glass. This means less frustration of a spilled drink. Smooth Rim A smooth rim allows you to sip from your stemless tulip-shaped wine glass without any discomfort from sharp edges that pressesagainst your lips and more of the enjoyment of sipping your wine. Usage Perfect for get-together parties, gatherings, picnics, outdoor activities, birthdays, weddings, housewarmingLarge capacity of 15 oz allows you to contain your favorite beverages so that you can enjoy more of it. Also suitable for use as aserving ware for yogurt, fruit parfait or deserts that is great for kids and guests. Maintenance Although the stemless drinkware is dishwasher safe, it is preferable that you hand wash it after every use to prolong its luster anddurability, as using the dishwasher might be too harsh on the drinkware over time. Bring home Opulic’s Unbreakable Stemless Wine Glass and frustration-free wine drinking experience today. No more broken wineglasses. Or simply give it as a gift of joy to celebrate with your friends, family and loved ones on any occasion. Click the yellow “Add To Cart” button at the top right-hand corner.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61aC9g442kL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Opulic","source_asin":"B074Y8ZV4Z","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-199638","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B074Y8ZV4Z","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B074Y8ZV4Z","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
