window.products.push({"id":199686,"name":"Bestar Cielo Collection, Full Murphy Bed kit (98‚Äú)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":2505.91,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61KvbsGNE5L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"For installation and to avoid risk of injury, use only a professional or qualified person with knowledge of the wall structure, studs, and components. Bed may be attached to wood studs, metal studs, or masonry wall structures; masonry requires use of concrete screws (not provided). Bundle includes: 59W Full Murphy Bed, two 19.5W Low Storage Units, two Sets of 19.5W Floating Shelves, two 2 Drawer Sets for Cielo 19.5W Closet Organizer Quality laminated particle board compliant with TSCA Title VI for a long-lasting finish Dual piston system allows you to fold the bed up and down safely and quickly Decorative brushed nickel handle and 2 CSA-approved LED lights (120 V) for a modern look","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61KvbsGNE5L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Bestar","source_asin":"B07K6TJSP6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-199686","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07K6TJSP6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07K6TJSP6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":199687,"name":"SOMERSIDE Desert Palms Sustainable Sand Free Beach Towel 63x63 Inches | Lightweight Quick Dry Beach Towel Made with Recycled Plastic | Large Beach Tow","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":40.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51R-5Nd13RL._AC_.jpg","description":"MADE FROM 85% RECYCLED PLASTIC BOTTLES, BUT STILL SUPER SOFT! Each microfiber beach towel saves 8-14 plastic bottles from ending up in the landfill or the ocean. Here at SomerSide, we are proud to be Global Recycling Standard certified. Yet, despite our focus on being eco-friendly, our extra large beach towels never sacrifice your comfort. Our innovative technology ensures each oversized beach towel is as soft as a puppy’s fur (or a kitty, if you happen to be more of a cat person)! SAND FREE SO YOU CAN LEAVE THE SAND CASTLES AT THE BEACH! We know how much you love a picnic or a sunny beach day (we do too). We also know how frustrating it is to constantly drag sand and crumbs with you. Well, we did something about that. At SomerSide, we designed and crafted a sand free beach towel! We want you to have fun in the sun without worrying about taking the sand (or the crumbs) home with you. Simply give your SomerSide beach towel a quick shake and voila, a sandless beach towel. HIDDEN ZIP POCKET & HANGING HOOK FOR EXTREME CONVENIENCE! Here at SomerSide, we strive not only to make a complete beach towel, but to make the ultimate accessory for travel, outdoor and everyday adventures. Each SomerSide beach towel is equipped with a hidden zip pocket for valuables, snacks and beach essentials so you can take a dip without the worry. Seriously, the pocket is hidden! Plus, our towels have a hanging hook so you can conveniently hang SomerSide Beach towels anywhere you go. WIDE, LIGHTWEIGHT & COMPACT TO SAVE SPACE IN EVERYDAY BAGS & LUGGAGE! SomerSide extra large beach towels are a massive 5'3ft wide – making not only a great beach towel for two, but also the perfect picnic blanket for the summer. Don’t worry though, these lightweight beach towels still weigh only 23oz! Plus, this packable beach towel isn't just for rollers – towel folders and scrunchers still get the benefits of our compact material (it just might look a little less like a water bottle.) ODOUR RESISTANT & QUICK DRYING MEANS LESS WASHING AND LESS HASSLE FOR YOU! Not just soft and eco-friendly – at SomerSide we've created an absorbent beach towel using odour-resistant, quick-drying material so you can stop worrying about forgetting your wet beach towel in your bag or your car. Our microfiber beach towel material also dries 4X faster than regular cotton, so you can quickly move from one activity to the next. Odourless, convenient, and absorbent – just like a beach towel should be.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51R-5Nd13RL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SOMERSIDE","source_asin":"B093BDXLPD","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-199687","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B093BDXLPD","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B093BDXLPD","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":199688,"name":"Zak Lun Sak-Ult Spiderman Size Ea","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71SO8x7JgHL._AC_SL1125_.jpg","description":"This insulated lunch bag is better than a brown bag – Spider-Man makes mealtime fun! It has a large capacity, easily able to hold a sandwich or snacks and a water bottle. The fabric's trim, matte finish, and full-sided artwork look great from any angle – this bag will be the talk of the cafeteria. The insulation keeps food cool and fresh so it tastes the way it's meant to. It's durable, lightweight, easy to wipe clean, and folds flat for easy storage when lunchtime is over. This insulated lunch bag even has a handle and Velcro closure for convenient transportation. It's 35% recycled material and 100% reusable, and eco-friendly alternative to paper bags that helps keep the planet green. This bag is BPA free and recommended for children ages 3 and up.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71SO8x7JgHL._AC_SL1125_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Zak Designs","source_asin":"B00M77A5P4","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-199688","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00M77A5P4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00M77A5P4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
