window.products.push({"id":199695,"name":"Beeswax Tea Light Candles - Pure All Natural Beeswax and 100% Cotton Wick - with Recyclable Packaging – Great for Any Occasion - Made in Ukraine Set o","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71uKOwLkJWL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"These wonderful Beeswax Tea Light Candles are the perfect aromatic solution to improve any setting and occasion. Ideal for home décor, weddings, holidays, dinners, sensual baths, romantic encounters, and even camping. It’s the perfect decoration. They will light up – literally - any room or space and enrich the ambiance with their subtle but beautiful smell. Our Beeswax Tea Light Candles are hand-made from 100% ALL natural pure beeswax – no other materials or chemicals were used in the process of making them unlike in the case of many beeswax candles on the market. The wick is also 100% cotton, which makes the burn beautiful and constant. The beeswax gives off a light and enjoyable scent that will fill any room and delight anyone who enters it. With a burn time of around 4 hours, they have an ideal length of burn time fit for most occasions or encounters. The Beeswax Tea Light Candles are eco-friendly and have a completely recyclable paper and wood packaging. There are also no chemicals anywhere in the composition or packaging of our candles. This way, not only you and those around you are protected from harmful chemicals, but the environment as well. The candles have a beautiful, cute, and soothing-to-the-eye honeycomb shape imprint on them – giving them a unique feature that sets them apart from regular beeswax candles. They are also great to watch as they burn to see the imprint slowly melt away. Another great use for our beeswax tea light candles can be for aroma therapy oil burners. Because the beeswax has a very light scent it will blend in beautifully and subtly with the aromatherapy oil’s scent. Bringing relaxation and peace. Enjoy these wonderful all-natural beeswax candles in the evenings at any location. They will help improve your mood and that of those present too. Made in Ukraine.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71uKOwLkJWL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Mokosha","source_asin":"B0841PC9FG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-199695","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0841PC9FG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0841PC9FG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
