window.products.push({"id":199697,"name":"Changshade Cordless Blackout Customized Cellular Shade, Honeycomb Shade with The Diameter of 1.5 inch Honeycombs, Room Darkening Pleated Window Shade ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":31.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Dy8mWVY4L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"CUSTOMIZED SOLUTION: We provide plenty of choices to fit your window sizes. Click \"Customize Now\" on the upper right to find more. Our Cordless Blackout Customized Cellular Shade are suitable for living room, bedroom, dining room, school, office, multimedia demonstration room, etc. (The width and height ratio does not meet \"width≥height/4+8 inches\", please contact us before placing an order) LOGISTICS AND SERVICE: We need 2 to 4 working days to complete your custom cellular Shades after the order confirmation. Please note: international shipping will normally take 7 to 10 working days, depending on the delivery locations. If you have any issues or questions in the process of purchasing, installation, or using, feel free to email to us, and we will respond to you within 24 hours UPGRADED CORDLESS DESIGN: The cord-free design provides a clean, tangle-free look to the window and creates a safer environment for children and pets; It will stay at whatever position you stop; The bottom aluminum rail is weighted and rigid so it hangs flat and prevents from wind blowing SMOOTH & QUIET GLIDE: Changshade robust constant force spring-loaded mechanism has passed 5,000 times usual lifting or pulling down tests for each blind and makes it easy to raise and lower the blind evenly every time and stay balanced automatically; it retracts and extends smoothly with constant force; our patented spring winder inside prolongs the lifespan of the springs, avoids the rebound or sagging performance and simplifies the mount of the blind ROOM DARKENING SHADES: Made of thick non-woven fabric and built-in environmentally friendly aluminum foil coating inside the honeycombs, it's super private looking from the outside, even at night with the lights on while having it down; Our insulated shades help block out sun and heat and makes the room more energy efficient","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Dy8mWVY4L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Changshade","source_asin":"B096WYPQ9Z","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-199697","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B096WYPQ9Z","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B096WYPQ9Z","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
