window.products.push({"id":199722,"name":"Easter Napkins Assorted - 50 PK - Easter Paper Napkins Easter Egg Napkins Happy Easter Decorations for Table Décor Easter Dinnerware Easter Party Favo","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":11.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71wmPqVCF0L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🐇 𝗜𝗡𝗖𝗟𝗨𝗗𝗘𝗦: 50 pack paper napkins. Measures approximately 13.4 x 11.4 inches unfolded; 6.7 x 5.7 inches folded. 🐇 𝗖𝗛𝗜𝗖 𝗗𝗘𝗦𝗜𝗚𝗡𝗦: These napkins are originally designed and printed by Winoo. You will definitely surprise your guests with these modern and unique designs in Easter themed party. 🐇 𝗦𝗨𝗣𝗘𝗥𝗜𝗢𝗥 𝗤𝗨𝗔𝗟𝗜𝗧𝗬: Each sheet is constructed with 3-PLY (3 layers thick), soft texture, fresh touch, durable paper, and highly absorbent. 🐇 𝗘𝗖𝗢-𝗙𝗥𝗜𝗘𝗡𝗗𝗟𝗬: Made of 100% raw wood pulp. Help the environment with these sustainable and biodegradable napkins while enjoying the party. 🐇 𝗚𝗥𝗘𝗔𝗧 𝗩𝗔𝗟𝗨𝗘: This party napkin is perfect to make a great addition to your Easter party at a value price. Order them now, and you'll always be ready for your celebration. Don't hesitate and hurry!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71wmPqVCF0L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Winoo Design","source_asin":"B0BWJP3ZHR","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-199722","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BWJP3ZHR","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BWJP3ZHR","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":199723,"name":"Blissful Organic White Sage Smudge Sticks with Flowers 3 Pack for Cleansing Home, Meditation, Yoga, Healing and Smudging | Sustainably Sourced Califor","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":29.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/718D4e4xNaS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"BLISSFUL FLORAL SAGE: White Sage is often used for purification rituals and for cleansing your space and self of negativity. These stagnant energies are transformed into pure bliss when encountering the luxurious and calming scent of lilac and the light and optimism of daisies. Lilacs are known for protection and healing, while daisies are associated with the summer solstice and friendship. USDA ORGANIC SAGE sourced responsibly in California proven to neutralize negative vibrations, improve sleep, as well as alleviate anxiety and stress. When burned the smoke heals and brings one back into balance and cleanses the body and mind of negative spirits and impurities. PRACTICE A SACRED TRADITION Sage is a traditional medicine plant of the Native American peoples, used for healing and ceremony. It is used for cleansing and purification, and to open people up to a greater connection with the sacred. It is thought to banish negative energy, not only on the physical level, but also emotionally, mentally and spiritually. Sage has a very aromatic, sharp and stimulating smell, and its action works on all the senses. USE FOR YOGA AND MEDITATION Smudging with sage is a powerful tool in spiritual practice. Burning sage improves awareness and focus. It commonly used to practice mindfulness and transcendental meditation. THE ESSENTIAL SMUDGE GUIDE Smudging how-to written in layman's terms. This essential guide details everything you will need to know to become a shaman-level smudging pro. FAMILY OWNED AND OPERATED: Purchase with confidence from a supplier you can trust! Our family has been in business since 1993, and nearly 30 years later we continue to proudly offer only the best in incense products","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/718D4e4xNaS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Ancientveda","source_asin":"B09RWGGXP8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-199723","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09RWGGXP8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09RWGGXP8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
