window.products.push({"id":199780,"name":"7 PCS Color Changing Cups with Lids and Straws for Adults - Reusable Cups with Lids and Straws Tumblers in Bulk Cold Cups - Plastic Tumblers with Lids","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Gi34IMJxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Set of colored tumblers with lid and straw for Cold Drink with Lids and Straws These special reusable cold cups will change colors and create a gradient effect when filled with ice-cold beverages like chameleons. The color changing cup comes complete with lids and straws that prevent spills. Each of football reusable cups is built with a circular ring that is convenient to open the lid and straw, preventing the straw from falling off. The changing cup tumblers are crack-resistant, which is a durable option for children. A colorful, blank body is perfect for customizing your style, make your own custom cups. Specifications: Material: Plastic Capacity: 24 Oz Size: Length is 7,8 IN, the diameter of the lid is 1,3 IN. Package includes: 7 x Color-changing cup with a lid and straw 7 x Straws WIDE APPLICATION: These reusable cups with lids and straw bulk are suitable for various drinks such as cold coffee, ice water, and cold juice. These drink cups with lids and straws can be used for birthday and holiday parties, family dinners. These drinking container with straw is also the best gift for your children, families, and friends. The helps keep you hydrated and is ideal for outdoor events. They are perfect for use in summer. COLOR CHANGING: The color changing cups plastic is reacting to ice-cold liquids or adding ice cubes, it changes from one vivid color to another as the temperature drops. The cold weather conditions can affect the color change. Please allow the product to come to room temperature to allow for the most efficient change. CONVENIENT STORAGE: The plastic cups with straws are available in 7 colors and can be stacked, which is convenient for storage. These bulk cups for vinyl projects can save a lot of space whether it is used at home or when traveling. It is obviously color-coding is a great way to stop someone stealing your drink, and a must-have for allergy sufferers.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Gi34IMJxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Lagarto","source_asin":"B092VXGYZJ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-199780","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B092VXGYZJ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B092VXGYZJ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
