window.products.push({"id":199925,"name":"Pots and Pans Set - Caannasweis Kitchen Nonstick Cookware Sets Granite Frying Pans for Cooking Marble Stone Pan Sets Kitchen Essentials Set Beige 13 P","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61s0noanufL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Product Description: Size: 11 Inch The Caannasweis family welcomes a new member. 🎉🎉🎉The 11-inch marble frying pan appears in front of us with a perfect shape carefully designed by Italian experts. The retro-style imitation wood grain handle , comfortable feel, and no mold. Creative drainage port design It is more convenient to pour soup and oil. Hanging mouth design is easy to store, and permanently secured with a stainless steel screw. Are you looking for a great gift to send to a special person for your life on Mother's Day, birthday and other special occasions? Look no further! Just try and buy it!🍳🍳🍳 Warm Usage: 1. Before the first time use, please remove the packing material and all the tags, clean with detergent or warm water, then coat a thin layer of oil or other greases. 2. Cooking Tools-Plastic utensils and wooden tools are more suitable. Sharp tools will damage your pans during . 3. Cleaning way-Better way: Hand wash gently with a soft cloth and dry it. For cleaning of stubborn food stain, you'd better soak the pot in hot water with detergent for a period of time. In general, a pot with non-stick coating can be washed by the dishwasher,but is not recommended to do so as strength of aluminum substrate will be reduced and the edible oil of the coating will be fully rinsed, Therefore, it needs to be reapplied with a coat of oil. The use of a dishwasher may reduce the service life of the pan！","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61s0noanufL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Caannasweis","source_asin":"B0B6VRXQ3P","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-199925","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B6VRXQ3P","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B6VRXQ3P","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
